{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvLx6rTo4ZuMVatBNKW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Well, I didn't really decide. If I had to put a finger on one, it would be **Harel (הראל), the track called \"כספי (שקלי)\"**. Harel is a big name I know, and that line says \"0%\" next to \"מניות\". It shows \"4.25%\" for 3 years, which looks a bit better than what the bank gives me on the deposit, and the fee is \"0.57%\". But I'm not signing anything until you and I talk, or until I ask the bank what \"כספי\" and \"סחיר\" mean here.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Screen 1:** It's dark, with \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" (all tracks at all companies) at the top. \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" was already lit up in green. Then a row of buttons full of מניות and \"S&P 500\", which made me nervous. On the second row I saw \"אג\"ח ממשלתי 3\". Government bonds I trust, but on my screen those three tracks never showed up.\n- **Screens 2–3, Harel:** I went down the column on the right. I skipped \"מניות\" and \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" because they're 94–99% shares. \"אג\"ח סחיר\" has 0% shares and costs 0.57%, but where the return should be it just says \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" (less than 3 years), so I can't tell. \"כספי (שקלי)\" was the only quiet line with a number: 4.25% for 3 years and 3.08% for 5.\n- **Screens 4–6:** Then Mor, Analyst and Meitav, the same kinds of tracks again. Analyst's \"כספי (שקלי)\" costs 0.71% and Meitav's 0.58%, so Harel's is a bit cheaper and I'd heard of Harel. By the sixth screen everything looked alike and I stopped. There were ten more screens below that I never got to.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"סחיר\", \"עוקב מדד\", \"גמיש\", \"מט\"ח\", and \"קופה\" with a number like 8211 and a little arrow.\n- The little round coloured circles. I couldn't tell the green from the yellow.\n- \"ההפקדות 0%\" under the fee.\n- Whether \"4.25% 3 שנים\" means 4.25% each year or 4.25% over all three.\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" next to a little orange mark.\n- The header says the returns are \"לפני דמי ניהול\" (before the management fee). So what do I actually get after they take it?\n- I didn't open the small \"?\" marks or the link \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\". I should have read that one.\n\n**What bothered me**\n- Dark background with grey writing. The headings at the top of the columns were hard to read even with my glasses.\n- So many numbers, about ten lines on every screen.\n- Nothing on the screen tells me whether any of this is as safe as my deposit.\n- I don't know who \"מקור\" (the site's name) is."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3871,"cache_read_input_tokens":11644,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3871},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bd32ac0-66ba-4b8a-a3ac-5a67a3b3179d","uuid":"1b160970-f514-4b22-809f-8ca769fd21b9","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:55:13.516Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvLwrj3GH3vVqdDvK1y"}
